Welcome to Kansas!

Made it halfway, but high winds and impending storms make it unlikely I will make it home tonight.

I how to take off at 8am. I am in a Denny's without any handguns. My brain is a little slow to turn over this morning, but I watched Dexter play with Weezer for a couple songs and that helped.</content:encoded>
